{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41594","headline":"句 · 沈彬","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尺素隐清辉，一毫分险阻。\n金翅动身摩日月，银河转浪洗乾坤。\n须知手笔安排定，不怕山河整顿难。\n九衢冠盖暗争路，四海干戈多异心。\n地隈一水巡城转，天约羣山附郭来。\n数家鱼网疎云外，一岸残阳细雨中。\n松欹晚影离坛草，锺撼秋声入殿风。\n压低吴楚遥涵水，约破云霞独倚天。\n半身落日离秦树，一路平芜入楚烟。\n清占月中三峡水，丽偷云外十洲春。\n幽鸟唤人穿竹去，野猨寻果出云来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}